+# Implementation plan
+
+Keep the existing source/retrieval/rendering pipeline. Add request-local OpenAI policy and bounded rate-limit handling in the existing transport. Replace omissions-only Meta review with a structured sequential reviewer using the same encrypted provider store. Run it once after an OpenAI draft exists and retain all downstream source and substantive checks. Report only stage, fixed error codes, counts and request IDs. Fix named self-identification and recalculate the panel after server preparation. No database migration or new access scope.
+
+Test regression failures first, then provider isolation, exact input handoff, reviewer failures, source rejection and payment preservation, role classification, existing memo/citation tests, protected-source audit and build. Publish the exact pushed source and rerun the synthetic case. Preserve explicit external blockers in the report.
